WEBVTT

00:06:25.344 --> 00:06:32.094
(Smeh)

00:06:32.094 --> 00:06:35.983
"(Oponaša Arapski) - duga!"

00:06:37.094 --> 00:06:40.088
"(Oponaša Arapski) - Tutti Frutti!"

00:06:40.088 --> 00:06:43.430
"Mislim da će oteti avion
sa nekim sladoledom."

00:06:43.678 --> 00:06:45.730
Hvala vam mnogo.
Želim vam prijatno veče.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:49.275
Hvala, TED.
(Ovacije) (Aplauz)